atcit><patcit ucid="JP-7085574-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country> <doc-number>7085574</doc-number> <kind>A</kind> </document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1204111A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA TSUYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KANAYAMA MASAAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MITSUBISHI CHEM CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA, TSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KANAYAMA, MASAAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITSUBISHI CHEMICAL CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA TSUYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KANAYAMA MASAAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA, TSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KANAYAMA, MASAAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A CD-R or CD-RW disk (10) is produced as a specific disk (10') on which a media number (1) which is a combination of a disk ID expressed by a decimal six-digit number, an MCN of a decimal 13-digit number, and an ISRC serial number of a decimal five-digit number, and encrypted data (14) encrypted by the media number (1) are recorded. The disk is subjected to a predetermined initialization by an existing formatting method. As a result, the user can copy data with copyright such as music, movie, or computer program data to a single disk only once but cannot secondarily copy the copied data on the disk to another disk, thus protecting the data with copyright.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un disque CD-R ou CD-RW (10) fabriqué comme un disque spécifique (10') sur lequel un numéro de volume (1) qui est une combinaison d'un ID de disque (exprimé par un nombre décimal à six chiffres), d'un MCN (d'un nombre décimal à 13 chiffres), et d'un numéro de série ISRC (d'un nombre décimal à cinq chiffres), les données chiffrées (14) chiffrées par le numéro de volume (1) étant enregistrées. On soumet le disque à une initialisation prédéterminée par un procédé de formatage existant. Par conséquent, l'utilisateur peut copier des données protégées par copyright, comme la musique, le cinéma ou les données de programmes informatiques, sur un disque unique une fois seulement mais il ne peut pas faire de copie secondaire sur un disque tiers des données déjà reproduites sur le disque, protégeant ainsi les données copyright.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>